OL,3,GNEWSATour of Britain inspiring more
OL,4,AMuslim women to cycle
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe organiser of a community cycling
OL,7,Fgroup has said this week's Tour of
OL,8,FBritain women's race can inspire more
OL,9,FMuslim women to get onto wheels.
OL,11,FShabana Seedat set up Spokes Sisters in
OL,12,F2023, after she noticed Muslim women
OL,13,Fwho wanted to cycle did not feel
OL,14,Fconfident enough to start, but she says
OL,15,Fhigh profile women's races are
OL,16,F"empowering".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1787226952
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATour of Britain inspiring more
OL,4,AMuslim women to cycle
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire will welcome the Tour of
OL,7,FBritain women's cycling race to the
OL,8,Fcounty for the first time later, with
OL,9,Fstage two passing through more than 70
OL,10,Fmiles (about 113km) from Clitheroe to
OL,11,FBlackpool.
OL,13,FSeedat, 42, said: "Seeing these events
OL,14,Fdoes encourage myself and my fellow
OL,15,FMuslim women to go out there and do
OL,16,Fsome more cycling."
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
